{"tutorial.explanation","Use the real settlement tools to complete this lesson. The tutorial only advances when the game state confirms it."},
{"tutorial.explanation.inspect_assign","The Gnome inspector changes the selected gnome's profession. Population & Work shows every gnome and lets you change each one individually. Both screens make the same kind of assignment."},
{"tutorial.explanation.stockpile","Build a workshop and place storage nearby. New stockpiles accept nothing until you set an Allow list rule. Allow raw wood, then link the stockpile in the workshop's Settings so the workshop can use it as a preferred source."},
{"tutorial.explanation.farming","Farm plan mirrors your farm's tiles. Select cells or All plots, then choose a crop. Assign sets each selected plot's ongoing crop; Use default clears that assignment, and Set farm default changes the fallback. Queue count schedules plantings per selected plot. Queue repeat cycles behind later orders. Select one plot to reorder or remove its queue. Seed totals and plot colors update live."},
{"tutorial.action.continue","Continue"},{"tutorial.action.skip","Skip"},{"tutorial.action.restart","Restart"},{"tutorial.action.hints","Hints"},{"tutorial.action.show_hints","Show hints"},{"tutorial.action.hide_hints","Hide hints"},{"tutorial.action.finish","Continue anyway"},
{"tutorial.incompatible.title","Tutorial unavailable"},{"tutorial.incompatible.explanation","This save was created with a tutorial scenario version this build cannot guide. Your world is preserved; continue normally or restart with a current tutorial scenario."},
{"tutorial.step.orientation","Find your bearings"},{"tutorial.step.inspect_assign","Prepare a woodcutter and check supplies"},{"tutorial.step.gathering","Gather wood and food"},{"tutorial.step.mining_levels","Dig a first room"},{"tutorial.step.stockpile","Build a workshop and link storage"},{"tutorial.step.crafting","Craft your first plank"},{"tutorial.step.farming","Plan your farm"},{"tutorial.step.shelter","Give gnomes beds"},{"tutorial.step.graduation","Keep your settlement growing"},
{"tutorial.objective.orientation","Practice moving the view and controlling time before giving orders."},{"tutorial.objective.inspect_assign","Assign a Woodcutter for the first tree, then learn where to see all your raw wood."},{"tutorial.objective.gathering","Cut a nearby pine and harvest the ripe strawberry beside camp."},{"tutorial.objective.mining_levels","Mine into the ground and connect a lower level with stairs."},{"tutorial.objective.stockpile","Build a crude workbench, allow raw wood in a nearby stockpile, then link the two."},{"tutorial.objective.crafting","Order a plank at your new workbench and check the result in Inventory & Resources."},{"tutorial.objective.farming","Assign strawberry to farm plots, queue plantings for them, and watch the first seed get planted."},{"tutorial.objective.shelter","Designate a dormitory in your dug room and place the five starter beds."},{"tutorial.objective.graduation","You have the first resource loop. Keep playing this world: expand food, workshops, and safe rooms at your own pace."},
{"tutorial.steps_heading","Do this"},
{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pan","Drag the map with the left mouse button to pan."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.wheel_level","Scroll over the map without Ctrl to move between Z levels."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.wheel_level_ctrl","Hold Ctrl and scroll over the map to move between Z levels."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.zoom","Hold Ctrl and scroll over the map to zoom in or out."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.zoom_plain","Scroll over the map without Ctrl to zoom in or out."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.rotate","Use the configured rotate controls or the rotate command when available."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.level","Click Z- to view a lower level."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.pause","Click Resume. If time is running, click Pause, then Resume."},{"tutorial.steps.orientation.speed","Click Fast to change simulation speed."},
{"tutorial.steps.inspect.select","Click a gnome on the map to open the Gnome inspector."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inspect","Click Expertise. Woodcutting is a skill and its level is shown in the list below Profession."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.population","Click Population in the sidebar. In Population & Work, open a gnome from Citizen roster to review individual assignments."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.inventory","Click Inventory in the sidebar. In Inventory & Resources, find raw wood under Item. Read Total, then open its row to see What it makes. In Stock counts only stockpiled wood."},{"tutorial.steps.inspect.assignment","In this gnome's Expertise view, open the Profession dropdown and choose Woodcutter. This changes this gnome's work assignment and activates Woodcutting and other wood skills."},
{"tutorial.steps.gathering.wood","Click Agriculture in the sidebar, then Cut tree. On the map, left-click and drag a small selection over a pine east of camp; release to mark it. If paused, click Resume and wait until it falls."},{"tutorial.steps.gathering.food","Click Inspect in the sidebar, then click the ripe strawberry east of camp. In the Tile inspection window, find the plant row and click Harvest. If paused, click Resume and wait for the harvest job to finish."},
{"tutorial.steps.mining.stairs","Click Mine, choose Stairs down west of camp, and wait for the first stair."},{"tutorial.steps.mining.wall","Go down one level, click Mine > Mine walls, and drag a small room from the stair landing. Wait for a wall tile to be dug."},
{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.workshop","Click Build in the sidebar, open Workshops, choose Wood, then crude workbench. Click clear ground south of camp to place it. If paused, click Resume and wait for construction to finish."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.designate","Click Designations in the sidebar, then Stockpile. Left-click and drag over a small clear area beside the finished workbench; release to create storage."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.allow","Click your new stockpile on the map. In its Storage management window, choose Allow list in the left rail. Filter Item to raw wood, then click the blocked raw wood row to allow it (or click Allow matches). Pine raw wood must be allowed before gnomes will haul it here."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.open","Click the finished crude workbench on the map to open its Workshop window, then choose Settings in its left rail."},{"tutorial.steps.stockpile.link","Under Linked stockpiles, choose your new stockpile from the dropdown and click Link. Its name should appear in the linked list."},
{"tutorial.steps.crafting.recipe","In the Workshop window, choose Craft in the left rail (click the workbench again if closed). Select plank under Available crafts, set Quantity to 1, and click Add order. Use Queue to see the order."},{"tutorial.steps.crafting.collect","If paused, click Resume and wait for a plank. Click Inventory in the sidebar and check its Total in Inventory & Resources."},
{"tutorial.steps.farming.designate","Click Designations > Farm, then drag a small clear area south of camp."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.crop","Click a farm tile, then open Farm plan in its side menu. Select grid cells or All plots, choose strawberry, and click Assign crop."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.queue","Choose Plantings per plot, then click Queue count. Enter 2 to schedule two plantings for each selected plot."},{"tutorial.steps.farming.plant","Click Resume and wait for a farmer to plant. Brown means tilled, green growing, and gold ready."},
{"tutorial.steps.shelter.room","Click Designations > Dormitory, then mark the room you dug."},{"tutorial.steps.shelter.beds","The starter kit includes five pine beds; you can check them in Inventory from the sidebar. Click Build > Furniture, choose Bed, and place all five inside the dormitory."},
{"tutorial.steps.graduation.review","Open Inventory & Resources to check Total and In Stock for food, wood, and stone. In a workshop, use Craft to add orders and Queue to review them."},{"tutorial.steps.graduation.continue","Choose Continue anyway to keep this settlement and play freely."},
